# W31, c (k10): joins a in stag0201 by the gate and goes on to stag0202 (matz00); sees the notice of a's entry and lets it
# run out (gone after 20 s, the offer stays on its page); when a went on to dng204b2 its row reads B2 without a new notice;
# then c goes along and joins a at B2's entrance.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@120
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log c in stag0201
idle until frames>=600
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control fail epoch>=@600
log c in stag0202
idle until notices>=1 fail epoch>=@1000
log c sees the notice
idle until notices=0 fail frames>=1500
log c's notice ran out
idle until offers>=1 fail frames>=30
log the offer stays on c's page
idle until offerstage=dng204b2 fail notices>=1
log c's row reads B2
goalong until go=waiting or go=stamped or go=going
log c asked to go along
idle until stage=dng204b2,present=2,sealed>=120 fail epoch>=@1700
log c joined a in B2
idle until frames>=120
